{"2784660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snow Cone Serenade", "steam_appid": 2784660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4202890], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/329d0d5cb88ec88796faf4cae95c119d.avif?t=1764418990\" width=560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/ea70ad8eab520143c7048394cb1b06ac.webp?t=1764418990\" width=770 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.poster.avif?t=1764418990\" width=165 height=133 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.webm?t=1764418990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/2c2c43f973851a392c710a88581652e5.webp?t=1764418990\" width=770 height=31 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short and sweet <strong>Liminal Adventure Game</strong>, with dashes of CRPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the people of Snow Cone, unravel a <strong>mind-bending mystery</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed or fail in spicy situations with a <strong>roll of the dice</strong>. Failing is half the fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Mood to get a bonus on some rolls:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be <i>Empathic</i> - Sense your way around a conversation with compassion &amp; charisma!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be <i>Logical</i> - Use reason and deduction to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be <i>Ruthless</i> - Confront things with some good ol' brute force!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experimental, synth-heavy soundtrack with bleeps and bloops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet loss</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/329d0d5cb88ec88796faf4cae95c119d.avif?t=1764418990\" width=560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/ea70ad8eab520143c7048394cb1b06ac.webp?t=1764418990\" width=770 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.poster.avif?t=1764418990\" width=165 height=133 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.webm?t=1764418990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_